  "d.109szp9": "Ehi ra kora nandjiwa ozondjuwo ndji u ma pu mo.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Ozonjuwo ndatu zezuva pombunda yehi romuriro. Omuzonde ouwa: ongoye yehi, okometa, nomiviri ominene. Omuriro u ya omaruveze ozingi.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Ombara yoye mwene ndji ehi raro ra pu pehi ya 0x40 i tarwa ngu STOCK, nao ongoye kape i yaruka.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "OROKETE",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Ombote yokuzepa yongarero ya zengwa pozonga yorelegana ya pokati, nozotureti zozoleyisa nozotjiputa zorokete omurongo na hamboumwe.",
  "d.11phsqq": "Omuhoko wongarero ndji i yuvo ovitwa vya tjitwa nAI 100% i yandja ongarero.",
  "d.11zjijr": "Ozoweponi zi yendwa nokutjiyiswa (ya tjiyiswa ya yarukwa), nozombote kape na ruwe omuvira.",
  "d.11zq7hg": "Omutarero: ozondjuwo zomapilota ya tjita omuriro, ozongoma ya ungwa, ongoma ya yenda neraka ra mapaa, ehi rongalaksi nomakwa, omuriro wokuyenda nomuriro wokukoka; okuyendisa kwa 0.1.0 ku ya ukwa.",
  "d.12zyt91": "ANVIL, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.13cb0px": "Ovahupu pombunda yotjirongo, na omuriro wokuyenda (GLASGOW). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.5.3",
  "d.1436q76": "Ouhorokatera 0.5.1 wa pu: omapanda wehi roweponi, ovirongo ya orokete hamboumwe, nehi rongarasa ya ANVIL tji ri pe NEEDLE 10.",
  "d.14s5uo6": "Omuriro wokuyenda pombote onene nombote yokuvara. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.5.3",
  "d.14vqvyw": "ANVIL na ehi rayo rongarasa ya pindurwa. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.14zbb1f": "Ombote yokuvara yehupi tji i tondwa nombaka yovahupu mehi ra THETA-7, ombuyu yongoye yayo i tjita omuriro.",
  "d.15oh132": "ouhorokatera wa pu",
  "d.16dme8w": "Ozoleyisa zokara zi tarisa ehi rimwe pombunda yombote.",
  "d.16sui9e": "Ombote onene yomuvanga yomukaanda, nohoko ya tjindatjinda, ozorelegana ivari ozonene nozongewere ozingi.",
  "d.177y6xj": "Omaenda ivari.",
