  "d.1hi6fk9": "HALBERD, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
