  "d.1i6l74z": "Okupita pehi pomunyo wokuzuva wa Copernicus ko ruveze rokutja, Okuti pombunda yoye. Ouzito wa hamboumwe nokape na omuhuka: omapanda aveni a tjiya.",
  "d.1ib4qda": "Ozimwe zi twara ozominigana zokara pu ozoleyisa.",
  "d.1iglk9h": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII: orunga rezuva na ozotjimbwa nomuriro onene.",
  "d.1imx84h": "LOW EARTH ORBIT: ehi rokuyenda na ozongoma zezuva pombunda yokuyenda kwa Ehi.",
  "d.1iuw2c3": "Okamera yokutjindatjinda ya ukwa, ehi ra AUTO ndji ri hakuvira omuhupu wa pehi, ehuka pokati ka AUTO nokukara pondjira, nokuyandja kwa nawa kuomupilota.",
  "d.1j7mgjz": "ANVIL ya AI ya hupu zi yendisa ozombaka yazo mekondjiso, ozombote zokutwara zi tjiya kongarasa, ozombote zi hakwa ombara yongoye yombote onene, norelegana zi ripura mwene.",
