  "d.1o102o0": "THRESHER, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1o89nc1": "ANVIL na ehi rayo ra pindurwa, eraka rimwe retarero romakoka okuvara.",
  "d.1ou7t1x": "OMUHUKA",
  "d.1pfk73q": "Ongoye otjiheko, ozombepo konyima. Ozoleyisa ivari ivari, ozongewere ivari ozihupi norokete ozihupi omurongo na ivari, ine yazo ze yuvo mwene.",
  "d.1pg1xjs": "OMBOTE YOKUTWARA",
  "d.1pptvj": "BASTION, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1q40xi9": "LEVIATHAN, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1qabcqp": "Omutarero wa SF wehi, omaenda hamboumwe, orokete norelegana, ozombote 16 okuza ko 12 m okuya ko 1.2 km, nokaarta ka Glasgow.",
  "d.1qngp78": "Etjivisiro rorokete pombunda yombote yomupilota mu THETA-7.",
  "d.1qqfryw": "LOW EARTH ORBIT, eraka rehi okuza kominu yongarero. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
