  "d.1tlqhpx": "Elogo ra Orion-81, ra tjitwa na Claude.",
  "d.1tn70tl": "KESTREL, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1u1n685": "WARHOUND ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.1uzcurt": "Ombote youvango ya Orion Defense Initiative: ozoleyisa ine, ongewere yehupi nehi rorokete hamboumwe.",
  "d.1v0q9n8": "Onene",
  "d.1va9vvq": "Ombunda yovitjivisiwa ya yenda ngu omwe.",
  "d.1vw6p3e": "Ombote onene yokutwara ya na ozongarasa ya kandwa, ya tjita omuriro, ozoweponi ozingi zokuhupisa nozotureti zorelegana.",
  "d.1wzm242": "Ehi rokuvara ra 20 km ku 20 km ku 10 km.",
  "d.1x5oilr": "Okutjindisa kwomuzengi (omaenda, ouwa worokete, oruveze rongarasa), omakoka ozombaka, eraka ROCKETS INCOMING nomapanda wozotureti.",
  "d.1x6m51e": "Ouhorokatera 0.2.0 wa pu: ongarero yomunene nozokaarta ndjetatu ozoupe (LUNA, EARTH ORBIT, SOL).",
  "d.1xdakgt": "WARHOUND, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1xeup9p": "Etarero rehepero ri kara nai: etarero rotjiya rokuyendisa komatjina ko ombaroro mombaroro yongarero yetjiwa ya GPL ri ya yenda ko {date0}, netarero rozondunge rozotjiyendisa ri kara nai.",
  "d.1xktp85": "OMBOTE YOKUPITA",
  "d.1xw8628": "BRAWLER ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.1y1vl1m": "Ombote yokutwara ya na ongoye, ya yenda nawa. Ozotureti ine nozoweponi ivari zokuhupisa ze zira ovakuri.",
  "d.1yawpsx": "OZOMINIGANA",
  "d.1yg6jc4": "Ozombanda zi yandjwa okutjiva ovandu ovingi nokuhakura ehuriro.",
  "d.1yq2qk7": "THETA-7 ASTEROID FIELD, eraka rehi okuza kominu yongarero. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.1ysusgc": "Ozombote ya hupirwa i kara ngahi nawa mokukondjisa ovakuvara kamwe ku ya tjitwa nai.",
  "d.21ryis": "Ozokurambo ZA ATTACK zi tjindatjinda pokati kehi rimwe nehi ra pehi.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Pokati",
  "d.2r8k8j": "OMUHUKA WOMBUNDA",
  "d.2sqinp": "Ozombote ndatu na omuriro wokuyenda pombunda ya Glasgow ya mbango, ya yendwa nombote yomupilota pombunda.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Etarero rotjiya rokuyendisa komatjina ko ombaroro yongarero mombaroro yongarero yetjiwa ya GPL ri ya yenda ko {date0}. Netarero rozondunge rozotjiyendisa ri kara nai. Ovi ya patwa nandjiwa ya ungwa matu vi tjita ovupe.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Omuriro wokuyenda wa tarwa okuza kozonjuwo, ANVIL ya 240 m na ongarasa ndji i tjiva nawa nozongaro, NEEDLE ndji zi pita kozombunda ozivari, ATTACK ya kamwe nandjiwa ya pehi, na ANVIL ya AI ndji zi yendisa ozombaka yazo.",
  "d.3b0pca": "OMUTARERI",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Ehi rimwe rokuhupa ozombanda zovandu aveni.",
  "d.3ednu": "Okutjindisa aveni okuza kongarero ya AI-BuB okuya ko Unreal Engine 5",
  "d.3m3q6c": "Omuriro wezuva, nomuriro omaruveze ozingi.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Okilometa omurongo na hamboumwe ya otjirongo pomuzonde wa Clyde pehi yombunda ya mbango. Ouzito wehuriro, omuhuka wehuriro, ozondjuwo nozotjiyendisa: kara mu nomaenda nokutja ongombe yoye ku i yuvo omuzonde.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, eraka rehi okuza kominu yongarero. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "ozotjiputa zozombote",
  "d.4pqks5": "Ombaroro yongarero i yenda pehi ya BuB, omatjina oupe a tjitwa na Claude Code. Ozomodula zongarero zi tunda kongarero yetjiwa nozina oupe konyima.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "Epandi LOADOUT ko tjiya ekondjiso aveni (omuvakuvara kamwe nehi romunene) na omiviri nongoye, ombara yongoye, orunyo pehi roweponi aveni nozombote zongarasa ya ANVIL.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "OZOLEYISA",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Kape na omuhuka: kape na okuhonga.",
  "d.61r5q7": "EHI RONGARASA NA NEEDLE 10",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Ozongundu zozotureti zoleyisa nozongewere ndji zi hurika mu AUTO.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Ouhorokatera 0 (omutaro) wa pu: ozotjiputa 8 zozombote, ozoleyisa nomaruyenda, ehi ra THETA-7.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Orunga rezuva, eraka rimwe retarero rozokaarta.",
  "d.709qra": "Kara u hakura opo i zara, pita opo i ya. Okupita ko 50 % nandjiwa ongundu i ya; pehi yaro i ya imisiwa.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Omapanda wehi roweponi, omaenda orokete hamboumwe na okamera yokukoka, omaenda ivari, ozoleyisa za ANVIL, ongarasa ya ANVIL ndji i yendisa NEEDLE 10 ozovakwetu, nokatjindisa kokutuhuka kwokamera.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Ovikwao aveni vi zengwa nAI pu ongarero ya BuB, na Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Ongarero yomunene yomo mukoyo (tara omakondjiso pu Wi-Fi omwe, kara nandjiwa pita mehi romunene, hurika kamwe; omapande okuvara kamwe nomuntu nomuntu) nozokaarta ndatu ozoupe: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT na SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.90i5d3": "Omuhuka wombunda.",
  "d.99x268": "PATHFINDER ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
