  "d.lomr5e": "RAMPART, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.m3odu3": "Ehi roweponi ndji i tjindatjinda: ongewere onene ya pombunda, ozoleyisa ivari, ozotureti ivari ndji u yendisa mwene norelegana yehupi.",
  "d.mmkrqn": "Wa zengwa pehi ya BuB nozina oupe. Etarero rotjiya rokuyendisa komatjina ko mbaroro yongarero yetjiwa ri ya yenda ko {date0}; netarero rozondunge rozotjiyendisa ri kara nai",
  "d.mubbp2": "PATHFINDER, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.mujtj0": "Ombote onene yokuzepa: ongoye onene, orelegana onene nozotureti ine zorelegana mozonga zivari.",
  "d.nrv8s2": "Ozorelegana yozonga ozinene pozombote ozinene.",
  "d.nuhm57": "Ozotjiputa zozombote hamboumwe, ozoleyisa nomuriro, nehi rozoyatjire ra THETA-7.",
  "d.p1uh6f": "Ongarero yetjiwa i hurika pehi yomatjina ehi Quake III Arena (GPL), nozombote za Elite Dangerous okutja otjiheko.",
  "d.pimdbg": "Ouhorokatera 0.4.0 wa pu: omutarero wehi: omuriro wokuhakwa neraka, omarunga a nomuriro, omawo oupe wezuva.",
  "d.pp01v0": "NEEDLE ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.qwk107": "Omatanga a yenda a tjindatjinda; oruwa orunene ku ru nga zepwa nandjiwa.",
  "d.r70f4w": "THETA-7 na ombunda ya 0.5.0 nozomatanga. Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.5.0",
  "d.rap4k0": "BRAWLER, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.reost1": "Ombote yokuvara na ongoye i ya omuriro woleyisa ko otjikaxa tjokutarisa.",
  "d.rexwmq": "Kara u hakura ehuka. Ozongundu zombote zi yenda omaruveze aveni omaenda wokuyenda, nozongewere aveni zokara nozotureti zoleyisa zongundu ndji zi ya.",
  "d.sdtkzv": "Epandi LOADOUT ra ORION-1 na omiviri nongoye, ombara yongoye norunyo pehi roweponi.",
  "d.sp0f4k": "Li pe ozongoye 3 zombara (STANDARD EMITTER, HARDENED EMITTER, DEEP-FIELD EMITTER).",
  "d.sudba1": "OKUHUPISA",
  "d.svcsep": "Ouzito 1.62 m/s2 (0.165 g).",
  "d.taax41": "Elogo ra Orion-81: ozongoma ndatu zombara ya mbwe nomuriro mehi ra silver ya tjindatjinda.",
  "d.tbfe8v": "Omitaro ya kandwa, ozombuku zomatjimbwa ya tjitwa.",
  "d.tg0hgk": "Ozomatanga zotjiruru nozovitwa mehi rozomatanga ra THETA-7.",
  "d.tg8bac": "MERIDIAN ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.tg8pdz": "Li pe ombara 8 zongoye, na ombara yoye mwene.",
  "d.th2bvi": "Omahi, mondjira: L1, id yotjiputa, ehi romuviri + ehi rongoye, ombara, ozotoken oweponi, id yombote, ehi romuviri yombote + ehi rongoye yombote, ozotoken oweponi yombote. Ombara '-' ya STOCK, 'p<k>' ya ombara k yopalete, nandjiwa omatendo hamboumwe a hex a pehi. Ehi ra kara tji ri '00' (omiviri), '-' (ombara, ombote) nandjiwa kape (omahi oweponi); omahi aveni a kara konyima yokuhura a ya kara a yarukwa, a konyima a kara. Omahi ombote a ri nu ombote ndji i na ongarasa pu. Ehi otjiputa tji kape na okuhoolola ri tarwa ngu STOCK.",
  "d.tjh47s": "Omuriro u ya tji ongundu i ya; ozongewere zi ya nomuriro ongundu nokupe pehi ya ongundu yehupi.",
  "d.tnqgr2": "Ombaroro yongarero ya tunda kongarero yetjiwa ya GPL",
  "d.tqhusf": "Ozongewere zokara zi tarisa kehi rokuhonga rotjiputa; ozotureti zi tarisa kehi rokuyenda rehi rawo mozonga.",
  "d.uq3bbi": "OZORELEGANA",
  "d.v0hnua": "Ya tjitwa ozotate ovo ku va na oruveze rokukara ovanatje vazo.",
  "d.va88ub": "Ouhorokatera 0.1.0 wa pu: omutarero wa SF wehi, orokete norelegana, ozombote 16 okuza ko 12 m okuya ko 1.2 km, okaarta ra Glasgow.",
  "d.vktsja": "OMBOTE YOKUTJIVA",
  "d.vway3": "Kara u hakura ehuka rorokete opo i ya omaenda. Ozotjiyendisa zi ya kamwe nkamwe nomagazini aveni i zarwa tji i hupa.",
  "d.w9u9l8": "Tu kondja okutjivisa omakondjo aveni oukwatjikondo wokuyandja ongarero ya tjitwa nAI 100%.",
  "d.wqqgrq": "Okuhupisa okuyendisa mwene: ozotureti za PD zi ya orokete ya hupu mokati ko 1.5 km, nokape pehuka.",
  "d.x2k8or": "Ehi rokuyenda na ehi rokukara. Ozoleyisa ivari, ozongewere ivari nombote ya yenda nawa mosektor: pita, tjiya, yenda ruwe.",
  "d.xd9o89": "OMUTJIVISA WOUVANGO OZINGI",
  "d.xee72g": "ORION-1, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.xnwaaf": "Ehi rokuvara ra tjindatjinda na ombanda yehupi, ouwa wa 8 km.",
  "d.xtzt3d": "Ouhorokatera 0.5.3 wa pu: ANVIL ya 240 m nehi rongarasa ndji i tjiva nawa, nokuyendisa NEEDLE kozombunda ozivari.",
  "d.xus0g5": "Ozotureti zoleyisa nozongewere zi kara MANUAL nandjiwa AUTO mwene.",
  "d.y0cdyl": "Omabanka okara, ozotureti zozongewere na CIWS ve kara ouhoko omwe wongewere; ozotureti na CIWS zi zara pomagazini omwe wozotureti.",
  "d.y22qv5": "IRONCLAD, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.yabbmd": "CARAVAN, eraka rehi rongarasa okuza kominu yongarero (omuviri ngu wa zengwa ko 0.3.0 nokonyima; ouwa wehuriro 256 x 128). Eraka mongarero, ouhorokatera 0.6.1",
  "d.ygdahp": "Ouhorokatera 0.6.1 wa pu: ANVIL ya AI ya hupu ndji i yendisa ozombunda yazo, nozombote ndji i tjiya kehi.",
  "d.ygdciu": "Ekondjiso ra LAN: omuntu nomuntu",
  "d.ykoysr": "KESTREL ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.yz0shp": "Ozombote ozinene okuya ko 351.4 m (ouwa wa BASTION) ze yenda mpano.",
  "d.yzucb5": "IRONCLAD ngu i tarisiwa mominu yongarasa yongarero, omuviri wouhorokatera 0.6.1, etarero ra ndatu pu ine pu otjirokuti.",
  "d.zemkuh": "Kara mehi roweponi nao ya.",
  "d.zflx86": "Oruvanga rwehi rokuhakwa rwa hakwa mongarero",
  "d.zitf93": "Ozominigana ndji i tjindatjinda mozonene ndatu: 3 000, 2 000 na 1 800 rpm pongewere ya tjindatjinda aveni (otjiputa tja 20, 30 na 35 mm).",
  "d.zpe8n2": "Okuhupisa kongewere ri tjiwa CIWS, ya pokati nongundu.",
