  "economy.todayLead": "Omiviri nongoye yepandi LOADOUT nombara yongoye (0.6.0) zi tarisa otjiputa tjomakoka nomatjimbwa ndji ozonjuwo zomaanda zi ya pe.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Molwi ozombanda zayo zi tjitwa okuhaaisa ovo. Ongarero i hurika ya tjitwa nAI aveni opo i kare nai; ozomuzeni ya hupirwa ve tjindisa ouvango wa AI, nombina yarao.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Nda yendisa momunene?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Okuyendisa ku na ongombe?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ozotjiwa",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Ku nai. Ongarero ya LAN pu mukoyo omwe i yenda nai (okuza ko 0.2.0); okuyendisa momunene ku ya zengwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Ongarero yetjiwa ya zengwa pehi yomatjina ehi Quake III Arena (GPL) nozombote za Elite Dangerous okutja otjiheko. Ko zuva rarivali ombaroro yongarero ya yenda pehi ya BuB, omatjina oupe a tjitwa na Claude Code; ozomodula zongarero za tunda kongarero yetjiwa nazo za pewa ezina oupe. Ovupe 0.3.0 wa pe ozotjiputa 16 zozombote omiviri oupe. Etarero rehepero ri tara kutja ombaroro nandjiwa nai ya tunda kehi rya GPL, nokutja omatjiwa kondando yozombote mape tiyire pu otjiheko. Etarero rotjiya rokuyendisa komatjina ko ombaroro mombaroro yongarero yetjiwa ya GPL ri ya yenda ko <0/>, netarero rozondunge rozotjiyendisa ri kara nai. Oviwana aveni ovi tunda ko, matu vi yandja nga ovupe nandjiwa matu vi tjita ovupe. Ko tjiya etarero ri pu, ku tu tja kutja ehi ra \"ku\".",
  "faq.questions": "Ozotjiwa",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ozombote, omatjimbwa, omatarero nokwao, ngu ozombanda zi pitisa. <0>Ombuku mepanda ndi<\/0> i tarisa otjiwana aveni nokutarisa otjitjindiso naye omuzeni.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Ozombote nomakoka ohange kutja zi hupwe mokuyendisa nandjiwa zi landwe. Ombote ya hupirwa i kara ngahi nawa mokukondjisa ovakuvara kamwe ku ya tjitwa nai.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ohange ndji: okuyendisa ku na ongombe na ozombanda zongarero nomatjimbwa ya hoololwa. Ku ya zengwa nai.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ouvango wa nane wa koopiwa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Ya ya ko, nopu ngahi?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Omahi ngahi ovandu ve tjindisa, nonu ma tjiwa ngahi?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Ongarero ya tjitwa nAI i yeruka ozomuzeni ngahi?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "I kara ya landa opo u hupe?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Kape na oruveze rokuya nokape na ehi ra ongombe nai.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code omatjina a Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games omatjina a Epic Games, Inc. Blender ezina ra Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous omatjina a ovahona vazo. Ozina aveni zi ri pu ovahona vazo nozi yandjwa pu okutarisa ovitwa. Orion-81 ku na ehokero, ouyeruko nandjiwa okuyuvo kuazo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ohange. Kape na ehokero, ouhoko nandjiwa okuyuvo.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Otjiputa tji ya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Ombuku youvango pu YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landisa Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Ovahoko vokonyima?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kape na ovitarisa. Kape na ozokuki. Epandi rokutarisa. Ovitwa aveni vi tunda mombuku youhorokatera; kape na kamwe mpano omuhapo nandjiwa eyuvo.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ku ya pu nai",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ekwao kamwe ri kara nai: <0>etarero rehepero<\/0> romatjina ongarero ya tunda kongarero yetjiwa ya GPL. Etarero rotjiya rokuyendisa komatjina ko ombaroro mombaroro yongarero yetjiwa ri ya yenda ko <1/>, netarero rozondunge rozotjiyendisa ri kara nai.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ongarero ya tjitwa omeho aveni nAI.<\/0> Ombaroro yene ya Orion-81 na Claude Code, mokuheko komukoke; ozombote, ozokaarta, omatjimbwa nozongoma ya tjitwa nozombinda ya yandjwa na Claude Code. Oruvanga rwehi rokuhakwa ndji ri yandjwa ri kunwa pehi ya <1>'Ku tjitwa AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Ehi repandi pehi",
